<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS3" title="In Appendix D Statistics of VideoVerse ‣ VideoVerse: How Far is Your T2V Generator from a World Model?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3 </span>Temporal Causality of “Event Following”</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS4" title="In Appendix D Statistics of VideoVerse ‣ VideoVerse: How Far is Your T2V Generator from a World Model?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.4 </span>Scene Coverage</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
