<span id="A4.T8.p1.pic1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.T8.p1.pic1.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A water droplet slides down the smooth surface of a marble countertop, </span><span id="A4.T8.p1.pic1.2.1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">remaining spherical due to surface tension.</span></span>
